01:00:14,534 --> 01:00:18,234
最後にもね 一曲ぺこら また歌いますので
Pekora will sing one last song at the end,

542
01:00:18,234 --> 01:00:20,234
そちらもお楽しみに ということで
so look forward to that! And with that...

543
01:00:20,234 --> 01:00:23,034
ここからはグッズ紹介！
...it's time for the merch introduction!

544
01:00:24,734 --> 01:00:27,234
お？あれ？
Oh? Wait, what?

545
01:00:27,234 --> 01:00:29,234
おっ 光った！
Oh, it lit up!

546
01:00:29,734 --> 01:00:32,234
お？ということは？
Oh? Which means...?

547
01:00:34,234 --> 01:00:37,734
キタキタキタキター！
Here it comes, here it comes!

548
01:00:39,734 --> 01:00:44,934
ということで 兎田ぺこら活動6周年記念グッズを紹介するぺこー！
So, I'll be introducing Usada Pekora's 6th Anniversary merch, peko!

549
01:00:46,234 --> 01:00:49,234
まずは一つ目は こちらから！トゥルン！
First up is this one! Ta-da!

550
01:00:49,734 --> 01:00:53,234
ぺこら推し法被！
The Pekora Fan Happi!

551
01:00:53,234 --> 01:00:56,734
こちらは憂姫はぐれ先生に描いていただきました！
This was illustrated by Yuuki Hagure-sensei!

552
01:00:56,734 --> 01:01:00,534
もうね 着るだけで推しをアピールできる
Just wearing it lets you show off your favorite oshi!

553
01:01:00,534 --> 01:01:03,234
イベントでも着てきてほしいぺこです！
I hope you wear it to events, peko!

554
01:01:03,234 --> 01:01:06,934
めちゃめちゃ可愛い法被ぺこなんで ぜひともよろー！
It's an incredibly cute happi, so please check it out!

555
01:01:07,534 --> 01:01:10,234
仕様変更：そして二つ目は こちら！トゥルン！
And the second one is this! Ta-da!

556
01:01:10,734 --> 01:01:14,234
な な な なんと！ついに！
W-W-W-What?! Finally...

557
01:01:14,234 --> 01:01:17,534
ぺこらマミーも写っているグッズが出てしまいました！
...merch featuring Pekora Mammy has been released!

558
01:01:17,734 --> 01:01:20,234
こちら ラバーマットです！
This is the Rubber Mat!

559
01:01:20,234 --> 01:01:22,234
イラストはHikoさんにお願いしております！
The illustration was done by Hiko-san!

560
01:01:22,234 --> 01:01:27,734
テーマはカジノの兎田ぺこらとぺこらマミーです！
The theme is Usada Pekora and Pekora Mammy in a casino!

561
01:01:27,734 --> 01:01:30,734
ついに出てしまった マミーが。
Mammy has finally made her debut!

562
01:01:30,734 --> 01:01:34,734
だからね ぜひともぺこらマミー大好きな人も
So, everyone who loves Pekora Mammy...

563
01:01:34,734 --> 01:01:36,534
お手に取ってもらえると嬉しいぺこです！
...I'd be so happy if you got one, peko!

564
01:01:36,534 --> 01:01:39,534
そして ラバーマットがあるということは 三つ目は？
And since we have a rubber mat, the third one is...

565
01:01:39,534 --> 01:01:40,734
こちら！
...this!

566
01:01:40,734 --> 01:01:44,534
はい カードスリーブもちゃんとあるぺこです！
Yes, we also have card sleeves, peko!

567
01:01:44,534 --> 01:01:46,734
60枚入りでね
It comes in a pack of 60,

568
01:01:46,734 --> 01:01:50,234
イラストは先ほどと同じHikoさんにお願いしております！
and the illustration is also by Hiko-san!

569
01:01:50,234 --> 01:01:53,234
なんとこちら ホロカでも使えますので
Remarkably, you can use these in Holoca!

570
01:01:53,234 --> 01:01:59,234
是非ともホロカで遊んでいる方は使っていただけると嬉しいぺこです！
So if you play Holoca, I'd love for you to use them, peko!

571
01:01:59,734 --> 01:02:01,934
そして 四つ目は こちら！
And fourthly, this one!

572
01:02:02,534 --> 01:02:06,534
可愛いね ぺこーにゃぬいぐるみキーホルダー！
The cute Pekornya plushie key chain!

573
01:02:06,534 --> 01:02:08,234
カバンにつけてもよし
You can attach it to your bag,

574
01:02:08,234 --> 01:02:09,934
旅行先に持って行くのもよしの
or take it with you when you travel—

575
01:02:09,934 --> 01:02:14,234
持ち運びやすいサイズのぬいぐるみとなっております ぺこ！
it's a plushie that's super easy to carry around, peko!

576
01:02:14,734 --> 01:02:18,534
こちらなんと フルセット購入の特典がございます！
And there's actually a bonus for purchasing the full set!

577
01:02:18,534 --> 01:02:22,734
数量限定ver.で 直筆サイン入りポストカードがあります！
The limited edition ver. comes with a hand-signed postcard!

578
01:02:22,734 --> 01:02:27,234
そして通常ver.は 箔押し複製サイン入りのポストカードとなっておりまして
And the standard ver. comes with a foil-stamped duplicate signature postcard,

579
01:02:27,234 --> 01:02:30,734
はぐれ先生の法被のイラストとなっております！
featuring Hagure-sensei's happi illustration!

580
01:02:30,734 --> 01:02:34,734
ぜひとも じゃんじゃんバリバリ買ってぺこー！
Please go ahead and buy them, peko!

581
01:02:35,734 --> 01:02:38,734
それでは 最後は何の曲かな？
Well then, what will the final song be?

582
01:02:38,734 --> 01:02:41,534
お楽しみに！
Look forward to it!

583
01:02:44,934 --> 01:02:46,734
係員をお呼びください
Please call the staff.

584
01:02:46,934 --> 01:02:49,734
ちょっと！ぺこ、ライブできない、ライブできない！
Hey! Peko can't do the live show!

585
01:02:49,734 --> 01:02:51,734
係員をお呼びください
Please call the staff.

586
01:02:50,234 --> 01:02:52,734
直してちょうだい！
Fix this, please!

587
01:02:52,734 --> 01:02:55,234
おい 監視カメラ見えてんだろ？おい どうにか
Hey, you can see me through the security camera, right? Do something!

588
01:02:55,234 --> 01:02:55,934
係員をお呼びください
Please call the staff.

589
01:02:55,734 --> 01:02:59,234
どうにか！直して早く！
Do something! Fix it quickly!

590
01:02:59,534 --> 01:03:01,934
ライブできないぺこだよ！
I can't do my live show, peko!

591
01:02:59,934 --> 01:03:01,934
係員をお呼びください
Please call the staff.

592
01:03:02,234 --> 01:03:04,934
叩いて 叩いてもダメぺこでしょ！
Hitting it... Hitting it won't work, peko!

593
01:03:04,934 --> 01:03:09,234
叩いて 蹴っても直らないだろ！ちょっと！しっかり！
Hitting and kicking it won't fix it! Hey! Get it together!

594
01:03:08,734 --> 01:03:10,234
係員をお呼びください
Please call the staff.

595
01:03:42,734 --> 01:03:45,734
仮想の世に生まれ 生きること
To be born and live in a virtual world,

596
01:03:45,734 --> 01:03:48,734
即ち 戦い、勝つこと
in other words, means to fight and win.

597
01:03:48,734 --> 01:03:52,234
時代と戦い 己が宿命と戦い
Fighting the era, fighting one's own destiny,

598
01:03:52,234 --> 01:03:54,534
自己自身に打ち勝つ
and conquering oneself.

599
01:03:54,534 --> 01:03:56,534
いつの世も大差はなし
In any era, there is no great difference.

600
01:03:56,534 --> 01:04:00,734
人の生き様が 一瞬の煌めきが 歴史をつむいでいく
A person's way of life, a momentary spark, continues to weave history.

601
01:04:00,934 --> 01:04:04,734
今こそ胸に刻め 我が生き様を！
Now is the time to engrave it in your heart—my way of life!

602
01:04:04,734 --> 01:04:06,734
永久に語り継げ
Tell the tale for eternity,

603
01:04:06,734 --> 01:04:08,734
兎田の魂を！
of Usada's soul!

604
01:04:08,734 --> 01:04:12,734
戦の炎 灯してみせよう！
The flames of battle, I shall show you I can light them!

605
01:04:32,234 --> 01:04:33,234
Are you ready?

606
01:04:45,234 --> 01:04:47,734
Shall We Dance? 始めよう
Shall We Dance? Let's begin.

607
01:04:47,734 --> 01:04:51,234
勝利の祝杯あげる前に
Before raising the victory toast,

608
01:04:51,534 --> 01:04:53,734
Relax Your Body 深呼吸
Relax Your Body, take a deep breath.

609
01:04:53,734 --> 01:04:56,534
そうすりゃだんだん高まる
That way, it'll gradually build up.

610
01:04:56,534 --> 01:04:59,234
Passion Force

611
01:05:02,102 --> 01:05:04,802
Passion Force!

612
01:05:08,602 --> 01:05:10,202
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6

613
01:05:10,202 --> 01:05:14,602
膝もっと引き上げて右手を上げ YEAH!
Raise your knees higher and lift your right hand, YEAH!

614
01:05:14,602 --> 01:05:16,302
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6

615
01:05:16,302 --> 01:05:20,102
○○○○○○ 六文銭
Circle, circle, circle, circle, circle, circle, Rokumonsen!

616
01:05:20,102 --> 01:05:22,302
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6

617
01:05:22,302 --> 01:05:26,302
まだまだいけるはず！もっともっともっともっともっともっと！
You can still do more! More, more, more, more!

618
01:05:26,302 --> 01:05:28,002
Take a Chance! Take a Chance!

619
01:05:28,002 --> 01:05:29,302
勝利のために
For the sake of victory!

620
01:05:29,302 --> 01:05:31,302
Take a Chance! Take a Chance! Take a Chance!

621
01:05:31,302 --> 01:05:32,302
Well Done!

622
01:05:32,302 --> 01:05:35,202
SANADA DA DANCE SANADA DA DANCE

623
01:05:35,202 --> 01:05:38,002
ひのもといちのつわもの
The greatest warrior in Japan!

624
01:05:38,002 --> 01:05:41,102
CHA RA CHA CHA CHA CHA RA CHA CHA CHA

625
01:05:41,102 --> 01:05:43,602
不惜身命だぜ
With no regard for our own lives!

626
01:05:43,602 --> 01:05:46,602
SANADA DA DANCE SANADA DA DANCE

627
01:05:46,602 --> 01:05:49,302
急げ夜が明ける前に
Hurry, before dawn breaks!

628
01:05:49,302 --> 01:05:52,302
CHA RA CHA CHA CHA CHA RA CHA CHA CHANCE

629
01:05:52,302 --> 01:05:55,202
赤く赤く備えたなら
If you are prepared in red,

630
01:05:55,202 --> 01:06:00,602
踊れ！歌え！SANADANCE 歌CISE
Dance! Sing! SANADANCE Exercise!

631
01:06:00,602 --> 01:06:06,302
Wow Wow Wow...

632
01:06:24,202 --> 01:06:25,802
(It's Cypher time)

633
01:06:37,302 --> 01:06:39,802
Close your eyes 瞑想
Close your eyes, meditation

634
01:06:43,202 --> 01:06:44,502
Don't think... Feel

635
01:06:44,502 --> 01:06:48,302
感覚研ぎ澄ませたなら高まる
Once your senses are sharpened, it rises—

636
01:06:48,302 --> 01:06:49,802
Passion Force

637
01:06:52,302 --> 01:06:54,702
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6

638
01:06:54,702 --> 01:06:58,202
フロントキックでツイストかまして 視線は下げずに、はい、ポーズ☆
Do a twist with a front kick, keep your eyes up, and strike a pose!

639
01:06:58,202 --> 01:07:00,102
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6

640
01:07:00,102 --> 01:07:04,202
回って回ってプンプン回って回転スピード増し増し
Spin, spin, spin around, increase the rotation speed!

641
01:07:04,202 --> 01:07:06,102
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6

642
01:07:06,102 --> 01:07:09,802
勢いつけて！そうだ！もっともっともっともっともっともっと！
Get momentum! That's right! More, more, more, more!

643
01:07:09,802 --> 01:07:11,302
Change the world! Change the world!

644
01:07:11,302 --> 01:07:12,702
Do or Do not

645
01:07:12,702 --> 01:07:14,902
Change the world! Change the world! Change the world!

646
01:07:14,902 --> 01:07:16,602
There is no try

647
01:07:17,102 --> 01:07:20,102
SANADA DA DANCE SANADA DA DANCE

648
01:07:20,102 --> 01:07:22,802
ハート燃やして不夜城
Burn your heart, sleepless castle!

649
01:07:22,802 --> 01:07:26,002
CHA RA CHA CHA CHA CHA RA CHA CHA CHA

650
01:07:26,002 --> 01:07:28,302
但惜身命だぜ
But I value my own life!

651
01:07:28,302 --> 01:07:31,102
SANADA DA DANCE SANADA DA DANCE

652
01:07:31,102 --> 01:07:34,102
心躍らせるために
To make your heart dance!

653
01:07:34,102 --> 01:07:37,202
CHA RA CHA CHA CHANCE
CHA RA CHA CHA CHA, CHA RA CHA CHA CHANCE

654
01:07:37,202 --> 01:07:40,002
熱く熱く構えたなら
If you stand hot and ready,

655
01:07:40,002 --> 01:07:43,102
走れ！回せ！しゃがめ！伸ばせ！
Run! Spin! Crouch! Stretch!

656
01:07:43,102 --> 01:07:47,802
空に叫べ！SANADANCE 歌CISE
Shout to the sky! SANADANCE Exercise!

657
01:07:47,802 --> 01:07:54,302
Wow Wow Wow...

658
01:08:00,302 --> 01:08:05,902
苦しい時や 辛い時には 体動かせよ SANADANCE
When times are tough or painful, move your body! SANADANCE

659
01:08:05,902 --> 01:08:08,802
天上天下 唯我独尊
Above heaven and below earth, I alone am honored.

660
01:08:08,802 --> 01:08:11,502
みんなで踊ろうぜ SANADANCE
Let's all dance together, SANADANCE!

661
01:08:11,502 --> 01:08:12,602
Let's Go!

662
01:08:23,302 --> 01:08:26,102
Take a Chance! Change the world!

663
01:08:26,102 --> 01:08:29,802
深呼吸 Ba Hoo-ooo!
Take a deep breath... Ba Hoo-ooo!

664
01:08:45,302 --> 01:08:51,802
本日も最終最後の時間まで、兎田ぺこら6周年ライブにお付き合いいただきまして誠にありがとうございました。
Thank you very much for staying with us until the very end of the Usada Pekora 6th Anniversary Live today.

665
01:08:52,302 --> 01:08:55,502
はい、ありがとうございました。ありがとうございました。
Yes, thank you very much! Thank you!

666
01:08:56,102 --> 01:09:01,602
残念ではございますが、まもなく本日のライブはすべて終了とさせていただきます。
Regrettably, today's live performance will be ending shortly.

667
01:09:02,302 --> 01:09:05,302
メンバーシップカードをお持ちのお客様にご案内申し上げます。
We have an announcement for customers who hold a membership card.

668
01:09:05,802 --> 01:09:12,302
メンバーシップカードをお持ちの方は、この後の10時15分より行われるアンコールライブにもご参加いただけます。
Those with membership cards can participate in the encore live starting at 10:15 PM.

669
01:09:13,302 --> 01:09:17,602
お持ちでない方もまだ間に合いますので、これを機にぜひご加入ください。
Even if you don't have one, there is still time, so please take this opportunity to join!

670
01:09:18,302 --> 01:09:21,302
また、グッズ販売の方もまもなくカートオープンとなります。
Also, the merchandise sales cart will be opening shortly.

671
01:09:21,802 --> 01:09:28,302
10時10分より販売となりますので、ご購入をご検討の皆様は販売サイトにてご購入ください。
Sales will begin at 10:10 PM, so please visit the store page if you wish to purchase.

672
01:09:29,302 --> 01:09:31,102
明日のご案内を申し上げます。
Here is the schedule for tomorrow.

673
01:09:31,102 --> 01:09:34,802
明日の営業は通常通り夜から配信を行います。
We will stream in the evening as usual.

674
01:09:34,802 --> 01:09:40,302
明日も兎田ぺこら、張り切って参りますので、ご来店お待ちしております。
Usada Pekora will be in high spirits tomorrow as well, so we look forward to your visit.

675
01:09:41,302 --> 01:09:46,802
大変なご名残惜しくはございますが、本日はこれにてライブ終了とさせていただきます。
Although it is deeply regrettable to say goodbye, this concludes today's live performance.

676
01:09:46,802 --> 01:09:50,302
最終最後までお付き合いいただき、ありがとうございました。
Thank you very much for staying with us until the very end.

